														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4812527">
									

<p>It's a pattern screamer what sues people. I could go on about why I wrote this, but I won't unless someone asks. I wrote it over the course of a feverish night, edited it over a couple days, and then left it sitting until I remembered that it still existed.</p>
<p>In the pattern screamer SCP tradition, there's not-so-subtle backstory hidden in the formatting.</p>
<p>I might expand on the proceedings with a Tale later on, depending on interest (both yours and mine). Stay tuned!</p>

